usage: tune_parameters.py [-h]
                          [--case {open_3d_case001,open_3d_case003,open_3d_case005}]
                          [--experiment EXPERIMENT]
                          [--plan-config PLAN_CONFIG] [--suite SUITE]
                          [--backend {wsl,native}] [--engine {latest,legacy}]
                          [--router ROUTER] [--router-timeout ROUTER_TIMEOUT]
                          [--evaluation-timeout EVALUATION_TIMEOUT]
                          [--max-runs MAX_RUNS] [--dry-run | --report-only]
                          [--resume] [--retry-failed]
                          [--confirm-thermal-source NOTE]

Phase-one OAT experiments; existing Router/evaluator helpers remain unchanged.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --case {open_3d_case001,open_3d_case003,open_3d_case005}
  --experiment EXPERIMENT
  --plan-config PLAN_CONFIG
  --suite SUITE
  --backend {wsl,native}
  --engine {latest,legacy}
  --router ROUTER       Default: Linux project/router for WSL; native platform
                        default otherwise
  --router-timeout ROUTER_TIMEOUT
  --evaluation-timeout EVALUATION_TIMEOUT
  --max-runs MAX_RUNS   Maximum NEW Router attempts in this invocation;
                        pending evaluations do not consume this limit
  --dry-run
  --report-only
  --resume
  --retry-failed        Explicitly retry failed/interrupted candidates using
                        fresh Labels; never overwrite
  --confirm-thermal-source NOTE
                        case005 only: record how the mismatched Thermal source
                        was verified
